@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-48 - Approve Return Request

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Purchases / Returns UI" as FE
control "ReturnsController" as API
control "ReturnsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: returnRequests, bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-48
FE -> API: PATCH /returns/:id/status
API -> Service: Execute Approve Return Request
Service -> DB: Read/write returnRequests, bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Return status = APPROVED

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Status hiện tại không phải PENDING -> lỗi
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Return request đang ở status PENDING
Post: Return status = APPROVED
Main flow:
1. Admin xem chi tiết return request
2. Admin bấm Approve
3. Admin nhập adminNote (optional)
4. System gọi API PATCH /returns/:id/status { status: APPROVED, adminNote }
5. System cập nhật status + adminNote
6. System gửi email thông báo cho user
end note
@enduml
